    <p>
      PasteDownloadApp is offered free of charge and without a login, and we intend to keep it that way. In exchange, we ask that you use it at a reasonable, human pace. Automated or scripted use that generates a volume of requests far beyond normal browsing can degrade the experience for everyone else and may be blocked without notice.
